1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,600
A fool, but an honest fool, he remains.

2
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:07,720
We've been strangely fortunate.

3
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:11,960
Pippin saw in the Palantir a
glimpse of the enemy's plan.

4
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:16,870
Sauron moves to strike
the city of Minas Tirith.

5
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:20,430
I will go. No, they must be warned.

6
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:21,740
They will be.

7
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:28,220
You must come to Minas Tirith via the road.

8
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:32,260
Follow the river. Look to the black ships.

9
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:35,580
Understand this.

10
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:39,460
Things are now in motion
that cannot be undone.

11
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:43,820
I ride for Minas Tirith.

12
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:47,760
And I won't be going alone.

13
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:55,170
How far is Minas Tirith? Three
days' ride, as the Nazgul flies.

14
00:00:55,220 --> 00:00:57,820
And you'd better hope we don't
have one of those on our tail.

15
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:02,500
Here, something for the road.

16
00:01:03,680 --> 00:01:05,820
The last of the Longbottom Leaf.

17
00:01:06,040 --> 00:01:07,500
I know you've run out.

18
00:01:08,100 --> 00:01:09,880
You smoke too much, Pip.

19
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:12,400
But we'll see each other soon.

20
00:01:16,260 --> 00:01:18,460
Won't we? I don't know.

21
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:22,180
I don't know what's going on.

22
00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:26,350
Mary. Run, Shadowfax.
Show us the meaning of haste.

23
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:27,080
Mary!

24
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:47,860
We've just passed into the realm of Gondor.

25
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:04,280
Minas Tirith, city of kings.
